  "content": "<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mwstitle section\">\n\n    <h1 property=\"name\" class=\"wb-inv\" id=\"wb-cont\" dir=\"ltr\">\nScience and innovation</h1>\n\t</div>\n<div class=\"mwstext section\"> \n<div class=\"container\"> \n <div class=\"row\"> \n  <div class=\"col-md-6\"> \n   <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Science and innovation</h1> \n   <p>Scientific research, funding, datasets, innovation support, facilities and educational resources.</p> \n  </div> \n  <div class=\"col-md-6 mrgn-tp-xl\"> \n   <div class=\"mwscarousel section\"> \n    <div class=\"wb-tabs carousel-s1 wb-init wb-tabs-inited tabs-acc\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"> \n     <ul role=\"tablist\" aria-live=\"off\" class=\"generated\"></ul><div class=\"tabpanels\"> \n      <div role=\"tabpanel\"> \n        \n       <a href=\"https://science.gc.ca/site/science/en/safeguarding-your-research\" class=\"learnmore\"> \n        <figure><img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/themes/science/carousel/1082_09_19SafeguardingScience_WebButton_653x194.jpg\" alt=\"\"><figcaption><p>Safeguarding your research: Learn how</p> \n         </figcaption></figure></a> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n    </div> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</div> \n<section class=\"well well-sm provisional gc-most-requested\"><div class=\"container\"> \n  <div class=\"row\"> \n   <div class=\"col-md-2\"> \n    <h2>Most requested</h2> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-10\"> \n    <ul class=\"colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"https://nrc.canada.ca/en/support-technology-innovation/financial-support-technology-innovation-through-nrc-irap\">Grants for technological innovation (IRAP)</a></li> \n     <li><a href=\"https://nrc.canada.ca/en/certifications-evaluations-standards/codes-canada/codes-canada-publications\">National building codes</a></li> \n     <li><a href=\"https://science-libraries.canada.ca/eng/home/\">Federal Science Libraries Network</a></li> \n     <li><a href=\"https://nrc.canada.ca/en/research-development/products-services/software-applications/sun-calculator/\">Check sunrise and sunset times</a></li> \n     <li><a href=\"https://nrc.canada.ca/en/web-clock/\">Official time across Canada</a></li> \n     <li><a href=\"http://asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/astronomy/auroramax/hd-480.asp\">Live view of northern lights cam</a></li> \n    </ul></div> \n  </div> \n </div> \n</section><div class=\"container\"> \n <section class=\"gc-srvinfo\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2> \n  <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\"> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/researchfunding.html\">Research funding and awards</a></h3> \n    <p>Funding and awards for scientific research, research infrastructure and research networks</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/innovation.html\">R&amp;D and innovation</a></h3> \n    <p>Funding, collaboration, commercialization and licensing resources to help fuel innovation</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/sciencesubjects.html\">Science subjects</a></h3> \n    <p>Government research and resources on a wide variety of scientific topics</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en/programs-and-initiatives/health-emergency-readiness-canada\">Health emergency readiness</a></h3> \n    <p>Advancing innovation and technology leadership in the life sciences</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/institutes.html\">Research institutes and facilities</a></h3> \n    <p>Government research centres across Canada and how to partner with or access these facilities</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/open-data.html\">Open data, statistics and archives</a></h3> \n    <p>Government data, statistics, analyses and archival information to assist with research and discovery</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/educationalresources.html\">Science education resources</a></h3> \n    <p>Activities, lesson plans, videos and more to help youth learn about science and technology</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/business/ip.html\">Intellectual property and copyright</a></h3> \n    <p>Protecting your intellectual property, trademarks, copyright and using IP as a business tool</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science/scientistsdirectory.html\">Directory of scientists and research professionals</a></h3> \n    <p>A directory of government scientists and research professionals</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/environment/our-environment.html\">Our environment</a></h3> \n    <p>Resources to take action to fight climate change and protect the environment</p> \n   </div> \n   <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n    <h3><a href=\"https://open-science.canada.ca/home?utm_campaign=fosrc-promo-jan-2024&amp;utm_medium=pog&amp;utm_source=ised-e\">Federal Open Science Repository of Canada</a></h3> \n    <p>The federal repository of scientific articles and publications from participating science-based departments and agencies</p> \n   </div> \n  </div> \n </section><div class=\"row mrgn-tp-xl\"> \n  <div class=\"col-md-12\"> \n   <section class=\"gc-features\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Features</h2> \n    <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\"> \n     <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\"> \n      <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-8\"> \n       <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/science/features/ar2-jh-moon-webbanner-360x203-002.jpg\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://www.asc-csa.gc.ca/eng/missions/artemis-ii/default.asp?utm_campaign=csa-asc-ar2launch-2025-2026&amp;utm_medium=pog&amp;utm_source=asc-csa-gc-ca&amp;utm_content=artemis-ii-mission-en-artemis-ii-launch-260208\">Follow the first Canadian around the Moon</a></h3> \n       <p>Artemis II: Canadian Space Agency astronaut Jeremy Hansen makes history as the first Canadian around the Moon. </p> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n     <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\"> \n      <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-9\"> \n       <img src=\"/content/dam/themes/science/features/1006_01_24%20CFI_Web%20Button__360x203.png\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en/programs-and-initiatives/connecting-families-initiative?utm_campaign=ised-isde-cfi-25-26&amp;utm_medium=web&amp;utm_source=web-button&amp;utm_content=ised-official-site-en-251128\">Did you receive a letter from the Connecting Families Initiative?</a></h3> \n       <p>Sign-up on the portal. </p> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n     <div class=\"col-lg-4 col-sm-6 hght-inhrt\"> \n      <div class=\"well well-sm eqht-trgt hght-inhrt wb-init wb-eqht-grd-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-10\"> \n       <img src=\"/content/dam/ised-isde/images/features/Horizon-Europe-360x203.jpg\" alt=\"\"><h3><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en/horizon-europe?utm_campaign=ised-isde-horizon-europe-24-25&amp;utm_medium=website&amp;utm_source=ised-science-innovation&amp;utm_content=web-button-en-241201\">Horizon Europe</a></h3> \n       <p>Access funding and international collaboration opportunities through Horizon Europe, the world's largest research and innovation funding program.</p> \n      </div> \n     </div> \n    </div> \n   </section></div> \n  <div class=\"col-md-4\"> \n   <section class=\"provisional gc-followus\"><h2>On social media</h2> \n    <ul class=\"list-inline\"><li> <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/CanadianInnovation\" class=\"facebook\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Facebook: </span>Canadian Innovation</a></li> \n     <li> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/cdninnovation/\" rel=\"external\" class=\"instagram\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Instagram: </span>cdninnovation</a></li> \n     <li> <a href=\"https://x.com/ISED_CA\" rel=\"external\" class=\"twitter\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">X: </span>@ISED_CA</a></li> \n    </ul></section></div> \n </div> \n <section class=\"provisional gc-contributors\"><h2>From:</h2> \n  <ul><li><a href=\"https://ised-isde.canada.ca/site/ised/en\">Innovation, Science and Economic Development Canada</a></li> \n  </ul></section></div></div>\n\n\n\t\t\t</div>"
